(7334481, 1144415, 83149, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but you should have used the full 1200px in width considering the lack of height.  The image look quite small.  The extra detail would have helped.</td>', 'Nice idea, but you should have used the full 1200px in width considering the lack of height.  The image look quite small.  The extra detail would have helped.', '2015-03-26 10:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7334789, 1144990, 102570, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting</td>', 'Love the lighting', '2015-03-27 07:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7335084, 1144928, 83313, '<td valign="top">I always have a hard time voting on shots such as this. It takes a lot of skill and much work with timing and lighting to nail the perfect frame. But it is something that has become a bit of a photographic cliche on this site and the personal appeal for me is limited. So I must give it a strong vote for what was accomplished, but I also have to reserve my highest votes for the entries that connect with me. I''m giving this a 7 and also expecting it to pull a ribbon.<br/> <br/>I''m also going to guess this as an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a> entry and if this is from someone else, that is a high compliment.</td>', 'I always have a hard time voting on shots such as this. It takes a lot of skill and much work with timing and lighting to nail the perfect frame. But it is something that has become a bit of a photographic cliche on this site and the personal appeal for me is limited. So I must give it a strong vote for what was accomplished, but I also have to reserve my highest votes for the entries that connect with me. I''m giving this a 7 and also expecting it to pull a ribbon. I''m also going to guess this as an  IreneM entry and if this is from someone else, that is a high compliment.', '2015-03-28 12:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
