(7336668, 1144878, 10702, '<td valign="top">Hi guys!<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the nice comments and thoughts, really appreciate them!<br/> <br/>The camera was set on the right date but a wrong year... the solar eclipse it self is not proof enough and of course the same rules apply to everyone.<br/> <br/>It''s a good reminder to check your dates when entering DPC challenges ;)<br/> <br/>Thanks for the uplifting spirits, keep on rocking!</td>', 'Hi guys! Thanks for all the nice comments and thoughts, really appreciate them! The camera was set on the right date but a wrong year... the solar eclipse it self is not proof enough and of course the same rules apply to everyone. It''s a good reminder to check your dates when entering DPC challenges ;) Thanks for the uplifting spirits, keep on rocking!', '2015-04-02 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7336899, 1144809, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s actually Eurydice who glanced back at Hades. </i></td></tr></table>you''re right and I''m wrong. Lot''s wife fell into my Orpheus.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: It''s actually Eurydice who glanced back at Hades. you''re right and I''m wrong. Lot''s wife fell into my Orpheus.', '2015-04-02 20:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7337612, 1144972, 96751, '<td valign="top">Outstanding concept, with a lot of potential. It is the execution I think is lacking. At first/quick glance, these are the flaws that compete and overshadow the image:<br/> <br/>grayish/bluish cast from light flare, especially in center of image<br/>glasses are not equidistant - for a precision shot like this, that''s an issue<br/>messy - most shots of this type are tough because of the cleanup between attempts. Water splashes everywhere are distracting and a detriment to the image.</td>', 'Outstanding concept, with a lot of potential. It is the execution I think is lacking. At first/quick glance, these are the flaws that compete and overshadow the image: grayish/bluish cast from light flare, especially in center of imageglasses are not equidistant - for a precision shot like this, that''s an issuemessy - most shots of this type are tough because of the cleanup between attempts. Water splashes everywhere are distracting and a detriment to the image.', '2015-04-04 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
